  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1401.03 “Agent of the commissioner” means an employee of the commissioner.\n\nSource. #8145, INTERIM, eff 8-25-04, EXPIRED: 2-21-05\n\nNew. #8342, eff 4-28-05, EXPIRED: 1-2-14 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)\n\nNew. #10507, eff 1-21-14; renumbered by #12615 (formerly Saf-C 1401.011); EXPIRED: 1-21-24\n\nNew. #13984, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 5-24-24, EXPIRED: 11-20-24\n\nNew. #14139, eff 11-28-24, EXPIRES: 11-28-34 (formerly Saf-C 1401.012) (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)",
